    [guillermo@darkstar paas-apps1-qapg]$ omc get cronjobs -n openshift-image-registry
    NAME           SCHEDULE    SUSPEND   ACTIVE   LAST SCHEDULE   AGE
    image-pruner   0 0 * * *   False     0        25d             70d

        ---

    [guillermo@darkstar paas-apps1-qapg]$ omc get jobs -n openshift-image-registry
    NAME                    COMPLETIONS   DURATION   AGE
    image-pruner-29769120   1/1           3s         2d
